OL,5,G0705 Don't Tell the Bride
OL,6,     FThe One at a Car Show: Adam has
OL,7,     Fdecided to throw his wedding to
OL,8,     FVictoria in the middle of a car
OL,9,     Fshow. With, for some reason, an
OL,10,     FElvis impersonator called Elvin
OL,11,     Fofficiating the ceremony.
