OL,14,     Fwants a serious, traditional
OL,15,     Fwedding. But we all know that's
OL,16,     Fnot how it works on DTTB. Her
OL,17,     Ffiance, Kyle, has plans to enter
OL,18,     Fher in a demolition derby instead!
