OL,5,G1300 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FIn Manchester, quirky couple
OL,7,     FSophie and Lucas aim to prove that
OL,8,     Flooks can be deceiving. Love is in
OL,9,     Fthe air on Ruth and Martin's
OL,10,     Fnight. And is Ryan and Warren's
OL,11,     FMexican feast too spicy?
OL,12,G1400 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FBickering in the kitchen spills
OL,14,     Fover to the dinner table in
OL,15,     FBrighton, in a week that also
OL,16,     Ffeatures a divisive Italian menu,
OL,17,     Fcold food and awkward
OL,18,     Fconversation.
